    sj:statement "The critical path runs V23-H, operator successor-digest acceptance, a fresh 12/13 court, the V23-Q release lane, PRs of both critical repos, exact-head CI with fix-forward, merge, requalification, GC23-11, a fresh 13/13 STOP=true receipt, manufacture of chatman-ecosystem/release/v26.9.23, the old-role crosswalk, root crown and replay, then the tag." ;
    sj:sourceDocument "release/v26.9.23/sjira/chatman-ce23.md" ;
